                                "sense_id": "b381bc17-3621-3448-9d67-8aa71d263faf",
                                "text": "They also demand that corporate boards establish explicit policies to guide expenditures on things such as entertainment and renovations — including corporate office remodelings — and make them public on their Web sites."
